SUMMARY:Frankenstein (1931)
LOCATION:Kendall Square\, 355 Binney St\, Cambridge\, MA 02142
DESCRIPTION:Tampering with life and death\, Henry Frankenstein pieces toget
 her salvaged body parts to bring a human monster to life in what many cons
 ider to be the greatest horror film ever made. The mad scientist's dreams 
 are shattered by his creation's violent rage as the monster awakens to a w
 orld in which he is unwelcome.\nhttps://booking.landmarktheatres.com/launc
 h/ticketing/adcc1a6e-70a5-5b5c-b6e2-188c07e71a19\nFrom Pushpin Boston: htt
 ps://pushpin.city/boston/
